  "notes": "H60B0/H60B3/R60B3 share goodsType 301 and differ by DIY/effect registration. H60B0 operate write and interaction layouts are delegated to base newdetail framework and not fully decoded here. Scene/DIY catalogues are cloud-served. H60B1 declares 3 color pieces but the 0x15 format allows up to 32 mask bits. Matter is commissioning-only; control frames stay Govee BLE/IoT."
